{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_title", "source_sha256": "9c78b11a92d01caa3f4a9589dbcd02c6e6230d87d37e044f7fbee2f56bc48593", "ja": "スマイル☆ファンタジスタ！", "zh": "笑容☆梦幻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_synopsis", "source_sha256": "62a6525ebc2e29f0e1292dd3f0bcb15bffef2df1f6099d1bba581ab7d9690b17", "ja": "劇場内ではレッスン（サッカー）ができない\nため、公園へと向かうエレナ達。美也がはぐ\nれそうになったのをきっかけに、みんなで\n手を繋ごうとするエレナ。全員で力を合わせ\n公演を成功させよう、と決意する。", "zh": "由于在剧场里不能做训练（踢足球），\n艾琳娜一行人决定前往公园。\n途中美也差点跟大家走散，\n于是艾琳娜决定和大家手牵手，\n众人也决心要合力让公演成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b455e7ca6f1e4c2ed848d0916e26caa0ec3504d275f03f8dc975f8adcdce7ac6", "ja": "（エレナ達の公演本番まで、あと3日。レッスンは\n順調らしいけど、みんなの様子はどうかな……）", "zh": "（距离艾琳娜她们的正式公演还有三天。\n训练似乎进行得很顺利，不晓得大家状况如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "84665906a7ae2fd1fa5242fe86a7c4b92f0cf24e8fe8dc6da5f8e006e6fcea5d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。\n{$P$}さんも、お散歩ですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了～\n{$P$}先生也是出来散步的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c647e4f865642e27281473385b1b4609fa685f7526594a16046c22b4b59669cb", "ja": "いや、今日はこれからエレナ達の様子を見に行こうと\n思っているんだけど……美也と琴葉は、散歩なのか？", "zh": "不，今天我正打算去看看艾琳娜她们的状况……\n美也和琴叶在散步啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "576ab1675c0800d673742c1cde68d4c1e974181ad09a8945c2320f41fcd2b37d", "ja": "いえ、散歩ではなく……私たちも、エレナのところに\n行こうと思ってたんです。一緒にレッスンしようかと。", "zh": "不，不是散步……我们也正要去找艾琳娜，\n打算跟她一起训练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "a0f2788e276a3aa24b1a2af11da44a1f201e47d1410d266e224fb4a8bd967cf4", "ja": "そうなんです～。お散歩は、ついでなんですよ～。\nふふふ。", "zh": "对啊～散步只是顺便而已喔～\n呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1005_p", "source_sha256": "64ecec9c0f95dc2608e856bcc5eea8dc543f0acd8355ff3ecbc9832f3c7bc1c5", "ja": "なんだ、そうだったのか。\nなら、これから一緒に……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n那我们不如一起去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1006_se", "source_sha256": "0f1ea69fead8824484300896d31a1dd24b9358f47231094c1af50dc403fd08de", "ja": "ガッシャーン！", "zh": "喀锵──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "19c0e89f62c600e756327247e10cbd1daf703599949e8bf6cf3279b1e8625b7f", "ja": "きゃ！？　……い、今の音は……？", "zh": "呀！？刚、刚刚的声音是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1ff0daee541a1334c64e927f3bb686184541b6b4a4b65fb94970d46209ed1383", "ja": "レッスンルームからだ。行ってみよう！", "zh": "是练习室传来的，去看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "4b66019144ea1e8e246925f41954cdae4ab3f5f9abf06f723351edad2d492381", "ja": "あちゃ～、なんでやろ？　どうしても40回の壁が\n越えられへん……もう1回！　もう1回やらせて！", "zh": "吼～为什么啊？不管怎么试都突破不了40次……\n再一次！再给我一次机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "6fe1e61adf784449b7926dbef0bf8fde9ac9228c5731c1dc81af8a5bd7436a61", "ja": "ウフフ、だめよ奈緒ちゃん！　次は私の番なんだから。\n今度こそ、劇場のリフティング女王はもらったわっ！", "zh": "呵呵，不行喔，奈绪！接下来轮到我了。\n这次我一定要拿下剧场挑球女王的名号！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1011_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5774e8def441c6788b2f20b993e0d81af685ded87cf1e1a59eca0a642b406aa4", "ja": "みんな、何があったんだ！　無事か！？\n……ん？", "zh": "各位，发生什么事了？还好吗！？\n……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "85cd3a1dab2f9f68278f27f06aea06403a0a70b53a8746009a08b66722991b9d", "ja": "おや～？\nこれは、サッカーボールですね～。", "zh": "哎呀～？\n这是足球呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "43e2c82496f5048a032112d3c286e3fe49ed488de622baa4810d7a11034b86f3", "ja": "そんな……どうしてレッスンルームに\nサッカーボールが転がって……。", "zh": "怎么会……\n为什么会有足球掉在练习室里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "fd56cd4ff46625f4e1bb4c67583a58a1fb4ba152eb1188de659365185580e661", "ja": "あっ、コトハ、ミヤー！　{$P$}も、\nみんなで一緒にリフティング対決しようヨ！", "zh": "啊，琴叶、美也！还有{$P$}，\n大家一起来挑球对决吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "18ba4a89f297b9fe331e23dc80542a4cd8404dd7432ba8e2c1e6d32976b35ac5", "ja": "お～、それは楽しそうですね～。\n腕が……いえ、足が鳴りますよ～。むふふ。", "zh": "哦～听起来很有趣～叫人等不及想大展身手……\n不对，大展脚上功夫呢～呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "08399c9b1788b815219a68d20824b2a63bafa05a3f918ad906e9cebc19c1ad83", "ja": "だ、ダメよみんな！　いくら広いからって、\nレッスンルームでサッカーボールを蹴るのは禁止！", "zh": "不、不可以啦，大家！就算这里空间大，\n还是禁止在练习室里踢足球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "bde4c551d793baf35d2451c8b1bad4d8792332d0b857fddf701ebda04ed754dd", "ja": "そうなノ？　でも、野球はダメって書いてあるケド、\nサッカーは書いてないヨ？", "zh": "是这样吗？可是，虽然有写不能打棒球，\n但没写不能踢足球呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "e9b6a06d7fd4b279f47587dad97bad9e8c87be3851eecfe86a8076455e7ba935", "ja": "そうだけど……{$P$}、すみません。\n私がサッカーのこと、書いておかなかったから……。", "zh": "话是没错……{$P$}，对不起。\n都怪我没有先把足球也写上去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1020_p", "source_sha256": "124d3e779cb525c6bdb4471c5957a0707d5d7f0cf956ca0479a439d7c8f02a21", "ja": "いや、そういう事じゃないと思うが……。エレナ、\n野球もサッカーも室内では危ないからダメだぞ。", "zh": "不，我觉得问题不在这里……\n艾琳娜，棒球跟足球在室内都很危险，所以必须禁止喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "2aa851d12529872a230550429a4c2f1a1d7d5d1fd0638e665d22414e853727e6", "ja": "ハーイ、ごめんなさい。今度から気を付けるネ、\n{$P$}、コトハ！", "zh": "是～对不起。我下次会注意的，\n{$P$}、琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "13ba815e6b874c3fc2ca9709d3ab63c389e3e92a1953de4bbc1442d6c0608087", "ja": "ううん、わかってくれたならよかった。\nエレナやみんなが、ケガをしたら危ないし……。", "zh": "没关系，你明白就好。\n毕竟艾琳娜和大家要是受伤就糟糕了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "746ccb9f326c4af72db4bba0c0f5094c2ffdf0127e8f513c68291f4153222afe", "ja": "禁止されてもうたら、しゃあないな！\nリフティング勝負はおあずけってコトで……。", "zh": "既然被禁止了就没办法啦！\n挑球对决只好改天啰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "c06df29c0646746b6dd19843d6dcc9d45f1b595224b94f1f7f8cabf455bcbe2c", "ja": "仕方ないわね。でも『女王』と名がつく以上、絶対に\n負けられないわ！　ね、{$P$}くん！", "zh": "没办法了呢。不过既然牵扯到『女王』的名号，\n我就绝不能输！你说对不对，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1025_p", "source_sha256": "79b998002e1bd5566332475d1031dcae0db98050cfa1ad8a0a07fe37c6ab88a9", "ja": "「ね」じゃなくて、莉緒は一緒に遊んでないで、\nちゃんと止めてくれないと……。", "zh": "还问我对不对，莉绪也别顾着一起玩，\n要好好劝阻她们啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "78ef30b361549507ddf3d35583cd12ccfebbd3e6f0ae927819c3c508b98752eb", "ja": "だって～。若い子たちがはしゃぐ姿を見てたら、\n負けられない！と思っちゃって、つい……。", "zh": "可是～一看到年轻人在嬉闹，\n我就觉得不能输给她们！所以下意识就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1027_p", "source_sha256": "41b41bb70138a9ffbf596d6f70496a7271215f05750ae688d67ac046484cf917", "ja": "次は頼むぞ！　ところで、今日のレッスンだけど……\nエレナ、どうしたいとかあるか？", "zh": "下次要拦住她们喔！\n话说今天的训练……艾琳娜有什么想法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "7f552860d4b643f83ca7ce8848f223ff5632385758c32d9adac703a4a3f3a2c9", "ja": "う～ん……じゃ、今日は外でレッスンしたいナ♪\nすっごくいいお天気だしネ！", "zh": "唔～嗯……那我今天想在外面训练♪\n难得天气这么好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "3d676741cfe0040f4841dfb0edcc6c1ba3abfa9ef2251751cfd3c70975861225", "ja": "いいですね～。広い空の下で、\n歌ったり踊ったりしたら、きっと気持ちいいですよ～。", "zh": "不错耶～在广阔的青空下唱歌跳舞，\n感觉一定很舒畅～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "7b9fe74ae71c4153d9bfea0ad0b02bb13eb86d3fdb8d9591a2ac97f1694ee964", "ja": "確かに……環境を変えて、気分転換を取り入れるのも\nいいかもしれませんね。効率が上がりそうです。", "zh": "的确……换个环境，转换一下心情或许不错。\n感觉可以提升效率。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "125d70d1a9f633fb22afee7e4e0125c70148d41a528b0a74d7761c3be1950bcf", "ja": "でしょ？　それに外なら、サッカーもできるしネ！\nそれじゃみんな、行くヨー！　レッツゴー♪", "zh": "对吧！而且在外面还可以踢足球！\n那我们出发吧！Let's Go♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "d637a236cb821f25d719088f4eafb311ced4b0fc690f1f98b60b27bd73d5925c", "ja": "え？　さ、サッカーじゃなくて……\nエレナ、待って……！", "zh": "咦？目、目的不是踢足球吧……\n艾琳娜，等等……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "fd15b8c24b5fa22675eda98c7b5b86810118fb4dd1e29136d0fad27c99ed2abe", "ja": "ん～♪　やっぱ、外に出てきて正解やんな！\n今日の天気は、中にいたらもったいないわ～。", "zh": "嗯～♪出来外面果然是对的！\n今天天气这么好，待在室内实在太浪费了咩～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1034_042miy", "source_sha256": "0492cebf47c35ab7f1ef73a0ad528b6658c02cb83eb865e4dc41709e618492cc", "ja": "あ、見てください～。\nあっちに、ちょうちょが飛んでいますよ～。", "zh": "啊，你们看～\n那边有蝴蝶在飞喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1035_018ele", "source_sha256": "7d33677aac760154029ec98ddae34486d613dad82dd83a8cc58f894db689daab", "ja": "ミヤ、そっちじゃないヨ！\n公園はこっちだヨー！", "zh": "美也，不是往那边走唷！\n公园在这个方向～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1036_042miy", "source_sha256": "efb7aa9fbb20fb8653396c9f9438474c2e0413d8a0dd033a741d56323946c1c3", "ja": "なんと～。あのちょうちょは、\n公園には行かないんですね～。残念です～。", "zh": "哎呀～\n原来那只蝴蝶没有要去公园啊～真可惜～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1037_018ele", "source_sha256": "d22cbc5ba0e5b8fc499e167634514714fa8bb9d9234435ba437d7d7c0f46c01a", "ja": "ンー……あ、そうだ！\n{$P$}、ワタシと手をつなご♪", "zh": "嗯……啊，对了！\n{$P$}，跟我手牵手吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1038_p", "source_sha256": "d96c25c1d1e380fc26a201ca7c1f02e474afa2f1b73b505c6c019447d1ce13c1", "ja": "ん？　どうして俺となんだ？", "zh": "嗯？为什么是我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1039_018ele", "source_sha256": "6371c62a00768cc85623d17742aa887bd7df149057ed7d0b8e173fbc7084fc98", "ja": "それは、ワタシがみんなと手を繋ぎたいからだヨ♪\nほら、ミヤも！　こっちこっち～♪", "zh": "因为我想和大家手牵手呀♪\n一起来吧，美也！这边这边～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "4a292e3b0717a177274df1583b28363a369d835d444039f54194d02533b5637f", "ja": "ほな、右手はエレナにゆずるから……\n{$P$}さん、私は左手お願いします♪", "zh": "那右手就让给艾琳娜……\n{$P$}先生，我要牵左手♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1041_p", "source_sha256": "e8ab08c4344c6a2812fe8897bd6b59ba2d2882b874bf0a3965217bb6b284bc0a", "ja": "……なんで奈緒まで？", "zh": "……怎么连奈绪也来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1042_042miy", "source_sha256": "98254210cd1ff816df621259fabae5631d0181579635f88cb9b30ac180b99cf5", "ja": "楽しそうですね～。\nわたしも参加させてください～。", "zh": "好像很有趣呢～\n也请让我加入吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1043_046rio", "source_sha256": "0e9cb87b10836779dea093ef076d72685d5fe489e7eb209848ec6ef9a554f4ad", "ja": "あら、{$P$}くんのお隣争奪戦？　\n面白そうじゃない！　お姉さんも負けてられないわ♪", "zh": "哎呀，要争夺{$P$}身边的位子吗？\n挺有趣的嘛！大姊姊我可不会输喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1044_p", "source_sha256": "dbb4809249dcd487783af467f6eb10cecc49a827d5588f08fc955c2d4a409335", "ja": "いや、だから莉緒は、\n乗っからないで止めてくれないかな？", "zh": "不不，我不是叫莉绪你别瞎起哄吗？\n帮我阻止一下她们行不行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1046_018ele", "source_sha256": "3af4f6a1e342207b0608aaf420f0a2cbc423b5b3ec5448dd6be5b31b521c7773", "ja": "コトハも、{$P$}と手をつなご！\nほらほら、早くこっち来てヨー♪", "zh": "琴叶也来跟{$P$}牵手吧！\n快点快点，赶紧过来这边唷～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1047_017kth", "source_sha256": "aa566d0dd678f2e817901d0b56358f37ed01df5f740cd49cf4f50f7a6f762d08", "ja": "えっ！？　わ、私は、そんな……\n{$P$}と、手をつなぐだなんて……！", "zh": "咦！？我、我怎么敢冒犯……\n竟然要我跟{$P$}牵手……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1048_p", "source_sha256": "7f00e548c773e2ec4fe3518e2f065a6881ff6a865459eff3ce14ce8123ed9404", "ja": "……よし、もういい、わかった。\nこうなったら……。", "zh": "……好，没关系，我明白了。\n既然如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_1049", "source_sha256": "22e6de173b2f2d0880d90b1bbd393d09d897abb498c92e09341e220f3559d44e", "ja": "みんなで！", "zh": "干脆大家一起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_2000_p", "source_sha256": "a264410dc987c408c1013964622324d2004443c19ec25dd45aa6af1bd11fac87", "ja": "みんなで手をつなごう！", "zh": "大家一起牵手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_2001_018ele", "source_sha256": "249475d6ebb16f9cb96924096896727e9bd37addfda354a13d4a592da583470b", "ja": "やったー！\nエヘヘ、{$P$}、だーい好き♪", "zh": "太好了～！\n嘿嘿，最喜欢{$P$}啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_2002_017kth", "source_sha256": "c910e25196184a6de8531460032e63970e0a15fe2ebb6fdc9bb5e48caf418e18", "ja": "{$P$}……いいんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}……真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_2003_p", "source_sha256": "2b4bb0b25081d9dcd0bbc6ee71c15f532111a58a74c58971e5b5b98531c1ee47", "ja": "まあ、減るもんじゃないし。最高のステージにするため\nに、みんなで手を取り合って進むと思えばいいよ。", "zh": "嗯，反正又不会少块肉。\n就当作大家为了展现最棒的表演，一同携手前进就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_2004_018ele", "source_sha256": "b5db6b12e535d25285da5eb9c2c1537a15fa4104051aaa44bae7f8a74f14f939", "ja": "さすが、{$P$}は\nワタシのプロデューサーだヨ♪　そういうコトっ♪", "zh": "说得好，{$P$}不愧是我的制作人♪\n就是这样子没错♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_2005_018ele", "source_sha256": "259956a8b89b8e927ee1249b69a88380accaf105901690610b6c9102020fe8c2", "ja": "大事なのは、ハートだと思うんだヨ。みんなのハートを\nひとつにしてとびきりスペシャルなライブにしようネ！", "zh": "我觉得最重要的就是心唷。\n让大家心连心，演出一场超特别的演唱会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_2006_p", "source_sha256": "ed8d143180525cb34b8e94951734124644fd4264ba112987ef5cf18d03400ab3", "ja": "……そうだな。\nみんな、今度の公演、心をひとつにして頑張ろう！", "zh": "……说得对。\n这次的公演大家要同心协力，一起加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_022_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_022_2007_018ele", "source_sha256": "20fdf810482bc7789b7d81eb3a9065a1faec878b878f9bb0114b4bbfcaf5a460", "ja": "ハ～イっ！", "zh": "好～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
